       seams and nothing from CareCrew (docs/xaf-editdraft-sample-consumer-2026-10-03.md). Expectations come from the Codex
       requirement-only list of run 2026-10-03-editdraft-sample-e817ca (tests a1, C1-C32). Packages: the centrally pinned
       NUnit, NUnit3TestAdapter and Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk versions (Directory.Packages.props); none is added. -->
